      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "text": "NESTED LOOPS\n\nA loop's Body can contain another loop. The inner loop runs completely for every pass of the\nouter one: 3 outer passes x 4 inner passes = 12 increments of the counter.\nA multiplication table cell is just counter = counter + 1 here; replace it with your own work.",
